# Description

This updates the **TextField** component, including new features and visual updates, and deals with technical and functional debts, as described in [DSY-2081 Update | TextField [RN]](https://natura.atlassian.net/browse/DSY-2081), and listed below:

- [x] Adding surface color background to the field that was previously missing;
- [x] Updating `Read Only` styles and behavior to better fit design definitions;
- [x] Adding new icons to helper texts when the component show visual feedback for validation **error** or **success** for accessibility purposes;
- [x] Updating `size` names to fit new design definitions (previous used sizes are now `DEPRECATED`);
- [x] Adding `action` attribute that was not developed before;
- [x] Adding `number` option in attribute `type` that was not developed before;
- [x] Fixing placeholder not showing properly for size `medium` bug on Android;
- [x] Refactoring code for good practices and reusability extracting components `InputBox`, `InputFeedbackContainer`, `InputHelperText`, `InputLabel`;
- [x] Updating documentation with new features.

No dependencies were added or removed for this change.

